    Eight items:

    B11-1 — in the card/row, add spacing between the record NUMBER and the record NAME (currently cramped).
    B11-2 — make the section/modal title a PCF PROPERTY (manifest), default "RELATED RECORDS".
    B11-3 — render the title per the OOB spec in `docs/standards/UI-DESIGN-STANDARDS.md`: `fontSizeBase300` (14px) +
      `fontWeightSemibold` (600) + `colorNeutralForeground1` (#242424) + 20px height + 4px vertical padding
      (`spacingVerticalXS`). Tokens only (ADR-021), theme-correct.
    B11-4 — remove the "open" icon on the last line item (owner unsure what it does; remove it).
    B11-5 — remove the per-row "Matched because …/Matched by …" subtitle text (not needed).
    B11-6 — the Connections MODAL content region must fill the FULL modal viewport (currently content only fills the
      top; the modal has large empty space below). Make the surface use the full modal height (flex column, content
      grows, footer pinned bottom).
    B11-7 — change the "Done" button label to "Save" (keep the existing save-on-change write semantics).
    B11-8 — move the Save button into the modal's bottom FOOTER (pinned footer bar), not inline in the content.

    DATA CONTRACT UNCHANGED: keep reading `sprk_associationprovenance` + `sprk_associationstatus` and writing via the
    existing task-042 additive typed-lookup path; only presentation/layout changes here.
