    <criterion testable="true">The "open" icon on the last line item is removed; the "Matched because/by …" row subtitle is removed from all row types.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The modal content region fills the full modal height (flex column; content area grows to fill; footer pinned to the bottom) — no large empty gap below the content.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The primary action button reads "Save" (was "Done") and lives in the modal's pinned bottom footer; existing save-on-change write behavior is preserved (still writes only on real changes).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The provenance-read + task-042 regarding-write DATA CONTRACT is unchanged (presentation-only rework).</criterion>
